# Secrets never enter the repo. Production values live only in
# /etc/ai-system6/env on the server; deploy/ai-system6.env.example (committed)
# carries placeholders. scripts/verify-web-release-safety.mjs is the gate that
# stops a stray one from reaching the public site.
